[399.263, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ Step 2 report. I've updated `prototype.html` and saved a copy to `.ambition/steps/2/`. `.ambition/first/` is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  untouched.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **What I did**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Fixed the four dead taps you named.** None of them was fully dead before, since they each showed a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  placeholder toast. Now:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - The notification chip opens a notifications sheet, and its unread count clears.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Share opens a sheet (copy link, share to club, save image).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - \"+ New\" club opens a create-club form, and the new club appears in the list.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - The settings gear opens settings (privacy zone and push toggles, units).\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Added explanations in context.**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - The post-ride screen now says what XP is and what the streak means.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Tapping the streak card, the level line or the \"Free · what is Pro?\" tag opens a short explainer.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - Send and Post with an empty box now say what's missing.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Guided the core loop.**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - The record screen has a demo tip saying to tap Start ride, wait a few seconds, then Finish.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m    - After saving a ride, the screen offers \"See my challenges →\", which goes straight to the challenges tab.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Added the rider materials.** `rider-test-script.md` has seven tasks, an observation sheet with a spot to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  note hesitations, follow-up questions, and a pass bar.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **What I found**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Click-through:** the cold-start run (sign in, record, XP and badge, challenge) passed all 13 checks with\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  no console errors.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Dead-tap audit:** I clicked all 180 controls across 16 screen states. 15 still show no change, and all\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  15 are re-tapping the tab or segment you're already on, which is correct. The audit also found no console\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  errors.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Four fixes:** a separate check confirmed all four fixes, plus the post-ride button, work.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Visual check:** I looked at feed, record, challenges and profile together. They render cleanly, and I\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  made no visual changes beyond the demo tip card.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **What I didn't check**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - The audit only covers the default screen states, not every sheet that opens on top. Those I only spot-\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  checked.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - It runs at one phone size in Chrome. I haven't tried a narrow phone viewport or other browsers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Changed course**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - Neither check script can tell a screen that changes from a change that makes sense. The first click-\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  through failed because my own new tip card was matched by mistake. I made the \"Start ride\" text in the tip\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  tappable.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The check scripts are in `.ambition/tools/`, with a README on how to run them.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
