[721.621, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ ▸ Step 4/8 · Challenge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Assumptions I'm testing**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  | # | Assumption | Who set it | Risk |\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  |---|---|---|---|\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  | 1 | A rider will wait a few seconds before tapping Finish | me | high: tapping Finish at once is common |\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  | 2 | Completing a challenge works, since \"+300 XP\" is on the card | plan intent, my numbers | high:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  untested path |\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  | 3 | The feed streak card stays true after you ride | me | medium |\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  | 4 | Level-up and ride summary don't fight each other | me | medium |\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  | 5 | A rider on a phone can replay or leave Pro | me | medium: the Reset button is on the desktop-only side\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  panel |\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  | 6 | The numbers are meaningful: 8 XP/km, 500 XP/level, a 200 XP freeze token, $5.99/$39.99 | me, not in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  plan.md | medium: invented values may bias testers |\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  I'll test the first five by running the prototype. For #6, I'll check plan.md directly.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
