[840.099, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ Step 4 report. The prototype is updated, and a copy is in `.ambition/steps/4/`.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Did**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - I tested six assumptions by running the prototype. A new probe script, `probe.js`, exercises each edge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  case. All six failed before the fixes and pass now.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - I fixed all six in `prototype.html`.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - I re-ran every earlier check with no regressions: axe, tap targets, consistency, the cold-start click-\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  through, the four-fix check and the dead-tap audit.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - I looked at the rendered challenge-complete and level-up sheet at 375×667.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Found**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Tapping Finish at once invented a ride.** The timer showed 0:00:00, then the summary reported 14.8 km in\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  30 minutes. It now says \"Ride a few more seconds first\" and keeps recording.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Completing a challenge did nothing.** The \"+300 XP\" on the card was never paid and nothing was\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  announced. It now pays out and shows \"Challenge complete\" in the XP breakdown, and the headline includes it.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Before, a 6 km ride that finished the weekly challenge gave +78. It now gives +378.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **The feed streak card contradicted itself.** It still said \"Ride before Sunday\" after you had ridden. It\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  now says \"Ride logged this week — streak safe\", and the notifications list updates to match.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **The level-up popup stacked on top of the ride summary.** Two sheets were open at once. The level-up is\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  now a banner inside the single summary sheet.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Phone riders couldn't reset or leave Pro.** The Reset button was only on the desktop side panel.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Settings now has \"Reset demo\" and, once on Pro, \"Switch back to Free\".\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Some numbers are mine, not the plan's.** The 8 XP per km, 500 XP per level, 200 XP freeze token and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  $5.99 / $39.99 prices don't appear in plan.md. The paywall now says \"Example pricing for this prototype\".\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The rider script tells you not to treat reactions to those numbers as evidence.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Changed course**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - I first thought the weak spot was the ride pacing, but the real gaps were in the reward paths: challenge\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  completion and the streak card. The probe covers those.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  **Not checked**\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - The challenge-complete path is tested with a seeded near-finished challenge, not a full week of rides.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - Still Chrome only, no real devices.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
